      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T23:17:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we really want to call this \"fernet receipts\" maybe auth receipts instead? or combine into main receipts section? Not sure if this is worth isolating.",
      "revId": "1514eaf699bfdd468229a80cbb89bda75ba20b30",
